          "explanationKey": "Name the U.S. war between the North and the South.",
          "facts": [
            "The Civil War was the war between the North and the South. It lasted from 1861 to 1865.",
            "Important events include the Battle of Fort Sumter, the Battle of Gettysburg and the surrender at Appomattox.",
            "After the war, Americans began a day to honor soldiers who died. Today it is called Memorial Day."
          ],
          "newWords": [
